        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Wandu wa Moabu wabonyere kaung'a sena na sena; kwa wundu ugho nichawikaba. Weremsowieghe mzuri wa Edomu ishima kwa kukora maindi ghake ghikawuya ivu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.2.1",
